    "notes": "<p>For the full description see:</p><ul><li>\"<i>Datasets and DeepMIB projects for segmentation of organelles of U2OS cell.pdf</i>\" document attached to this deposition</li><li>Explanation video on youtube.com (<a href=\"https://youtu.be/-IXB4Da9VMw\">https://youtu.be/-IXB4Da9VMw</a>)</li></ul>",
    "method": "<p>Training of convolutional neural network models and prediction of datasets were done in DeepMIB tool of Microscopy Image Browser (<a href=\"https://mib.helsinki.fi/\">https://mib.helsinki.fi/</a>)</p>"
